  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Equiatomic cast HfNbTaTiZr has 8–16% room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Equiatomic cast HfNbTaTiZr has a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Equiatomic cast HfNbTaTiZr has inadequate oxygen resistance at elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr undergoes rapid oxidation or pesting during a 5-hour air exposure at about 800 °C.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 3 at.% Al should be added to equiatomic cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 3 at.% Al will improve the oxygen resistance of equiatomic cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al addition will promote formation of a dense, continuous, and adherent Al2O3 surface scale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Added Al will preferentially oxidize at the high-temperature surface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting Al2O3 film will act as a diffusion barrier to oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film will significantly reduce oxidation of the underlying metal matrix.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will have substantially lower oxidation weight gain than untreated equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr after 5 hours in air at 800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain useful room-temperature tensile ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-modified alloy will retain useful high-temperature yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The cited refractory high-entropy alloy formed an external oxide containing dispersed Al2O3.",
      "field": "supporting_evidence_ids",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "External oxide-layer characteristics can strongly influence oxidation weight gain in a refractory high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beneficial effect of Al in forming protective oxide scales is well established in other alloy systems.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis is limited to a 5-hour exposure in air at approximately 800 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal Al concentration and the effects of Al on microstructure, mechanical properties, and phase stability are uncertain.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
